WEBVTT

00:15.239 --> 00:24.841
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

01:31.307 --> 01:36.568
PLAN 23
EASTERLY WIND / WEAPON

01:37.236 --> 01:38.446
Futaba here.

01:38.446 --> 01:40.952
As planned,
the front entrance has been secured.

01:42.204 --> 01:45.962
For spies, you sure are a violent bunch.

01:46.254 --> 01:50.680
Akai? Make sure you take her alive
so we can use her for research.

01:51.013 --> 01:52.141
I know.

01:52.684 --> 01:53.811
Just shut up.

01:55.857 --> 01:59.447
You might have been able to deflect it
in midair with your weird move,

01:59.739 --> 02:01.827
but you're not getting away this time!

02:11.972 --> 02:13.934
Those flames are pretty pesky.

02:14.435 --> 02:17.901
Seems like they're emitting
a flammable liquid or something.

02:20.280 --> 02:22.451
She's the eldest Yozakura daughter.

02:22.451 --> 02:24.789
You mustn't let down your guard, Ms. Akai.

02:24.789 --> 02:26.292
Don't get hurt, okay?

02:26.292 --> 02:30.300
Shut your mouth.
I don't need a kid worrying about me.

02:32.847 --> 02:34.726
What a scumbag!

02:34.726 --> 02:36.647
I can hear you, you fluffy-haired jerk!

02:36.647 --> 02:38.358
Sorry about that!

02:38.358 --> 02:40.111
What a scumbag.

02:40.111 --> 02:41.489
Shut up, snot-nose!

02:42.324 --> 02:44.245
I just said I was sorry.

02:45.163 --> 02:46.875
All right, Chacha.

02:46.875 --> 02:49.673
Call for outside reinforcements,
just in case.

02:49.673 --> 02:51.175
Can't make that happen right away.

02:54.014 --> 02:55.643
Wow, that's my girl!

02:55.643 --> 03:00.318
Fire one each at Sigma D2
and Omega R56, too.

03:04.661 --> 03:06.289
Perfect!

03:06.289 --> 03:07.291
Of course it is.

03:08.001 --> 03:09.588
That makes eight of them!

03:10.088 --> 03:13.554
Just pinpoint the target,
and the leave the rest to me.

03:13.804 --> 03:16.392
Seriously? What are we going to do?

03:16.392 --> 03:19.524
I've sent in Kurosawa as backup.

03:20.818 --> 03:23.239
Guess I have no choice but to go, too.

03:25.410 --> 03:26.830
Mr. Aonuma...

03:27.540 --> 03:32.132
My grandma always used to tell me,
"Discretion is the better part of valor."

03:33.176 --> 03:36.600
If it comes to it, I'll desert you all
to make sure I survive.

03:37.225 --> 03:40.566
Jeez, every last one of you...

03:47.997 --> 03:50.418
Uh-oh, now there's more of them!

03:52.632 --> 03:53.634
Hold up.

04:07.954 --> 04:09.708
KUROSAWA HAZAKURA EFFICIENCY 501%
(NUMBER 2 IN THE NIJIBANA)

04:10.291 --> 04:11.335
Taiyo!

04:23.902 --> 04:25.280
Leave this one to me.

04:25.781 --> 04:26.658
I'm counting on you.

04:26.658 --> 04:27.952
Everyone else, keep moving forward!

04:28.871 --> 04:30.708
So his whole body's made of steel, huh?

04:31.752 --> 04:34.006
My bullets can't seem to pierce him.

04:43.525 --> 04:46.907
Oh, come on,
we're not assassins, all right?

04:47.909 --> 04:49.913
Kawashita's our only target.

04:50.205 --> 04:53.837
Instead of sacrificing your people for
nothing, it would be better to surrender.

04:55.006 --> 04:57.512
As if sacrifices mean crap.

04:59.139 --> 05:03.524
I've got absolutely nothing to lose.

05:12.415 --> 05:14.796
Well, well. Those eyes...

05:15.673 --> 05:17.342
You know what...

05:18.637 --> 05:20.098
I'm going to kill you after all.

05:21.392 --> 05:23.062
Blade of Ash.

05:25.818 --> 05:27.989
A thermal ray of condensed heat!

05:28.615 --> 05:31.370
Both the speed
and amount of heat are soaring.

05:32.205 --> 05:33.040
But...

05:33.457 --> 05:34.752
I can deflect it.

05:44.146 --> 05:45.398
That was the right move.

05:46.192 --> 05:50.408
My flames will engulf you persistently
and can never be put out,

05:50.408 --> 05:52.663
not until it burns away
everything it touches.

05:53.916 --> 05:56.045
Let's see you try to deflect them.

05:58.884 --> 05:59.886
Burning Sea.

06:06.858 --> 06:08.820
Yozakura Style Jujutsu...

06:08.820 --> 06:10.281
Cascading Kumite...

06:11.952 --> 06:13.079
Seaweed!

06:13.245 --> 06:18.005
You're keeping the thermal rays at bay
by controlling the air around you, huh?

06:18.924 --> 06:20.761
Not bad at all.

06:21.053 --> 06:23.474
But the thing about gimmicks...

06:23.892 --> 06:25.938
is that you can crush them with volume!

06:39.799 --> 06:41.176
Don't stop. Keep running.

06:45.811 --> 06:48.525
The radar's not picking anything up
because of the heat.

06:49.861 --> 06:51.280
Big Sis Futaba.

06:52.700 --> 06:54.787
Akai's Blooming has been activated.

06:55.748 --> 06:59.004
Just an ordinary high schooler
at first glance,

06:59.004 --> 07:01.676
whom I found after hacking
through nationwide medical records.

07:02.595 --> 07:05.976
To think that she'd
have matured to this extent.

07:08.774 --> 07:10.151
No way.

07:10.443 --> 07:15.328
Just when I thought that I'd found
someone compatible with Hazakura...

07:32.153 --> 07:34.407
A pyromaniac, huh?

07:35.661 --> 07:37.540
Hold up. Forget that.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.710
Before the firefighters come...

07:43.384 --> 07:46.641
Looks like we'll be able
to secure our test subject.

07:47.518 --> 07:51.066
Good thing I was able
to use her siblings' bodies.

07:57.621 --> 07:59.207
F-Forgive me!

07:59.792 --> 08:03.174
It won't make your family happy
if you do this to me!

08:11.315 --> 08:13.068
Feel better now?

08:20.082 --> 08:25.301
The stimulation of scorching heat
and Hazakura led to her rebirth.

08:25.886 --> 08:28.307
Did she win, I wonder?

08:28.307 --> 08:30.771
You can do it, Ms. Akai!

08:33.944 --> 08:39.204
Everyone who's ever pissed me off,
I've used this power to kill them.

08:42.168 --> 08:46.134
You may be able to deflect it,
but you can't block the heat.

08:47.053 --> 08:52.355
If I keep cranking up the heat,
eventually you'll be reduced to ashes.

08:53.440 --> 08:56.446
If you don't want to die,
then be ready to kill me.

08:58.827 --> 09:01.833
I'm not planning to kill you
or die myself, for that matter.

09:03.002 --> 09:04.337
All I'm going to do...

09:04.964 --> 09:07.553
is take the hostility
and murderous intent inside you...

09:09.097 --> 09:10.726
and embrace it all.

09:14.609 --> 09:15.861
What's this?

09:16.696 --> 09:18.950
It's the Yozakura Blooming.

09:19.618 --> 09:23.668
It's someinine activated to its peak
and the Yozakuras' trump card.

09:23.877 --> 09:26.381
And it's also the linchpin of my strategy.

09:27.300 --> 09:30.181
Hazakura's Blooming
has come as close as it can get,

09:30.181 --> 09:32.101
but it's no match for the real thing.

09:33.020 --> 09:36.068
If you happen to come into contact
with them down the road...

09:36.443 --> 09:38.405
whatever you do, don't try to fight them.

09:40.284 --> 09:42.831
You don't look that different to me.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.504
Just how strong are you?

09:46.296 --> 09:48.133
I'll be happy to test you!

10:00.617 --> 10:01.577
It went out?

10:03.455 --> 10:07.004
It's not magic, so don't be surprised.

10:07.923 --> 10:11.221
This is my Blooming, Magnanimity.

10:12.348 --> 10:14.937
My kinetic vision
enhanced to its maximum limit

10:15.396 --> 10:17.609
and my accurate, sensitive fingertips.

10:18.903 --> 10:23.370
The aiki that they produce
envelops all attacks and neutralizes them.

10:27.838 --> 10:31.762
Not even the flames of your hostility
can pierce through me anymore.

10:34.685 --> 10:36.731
You sure are confident about that.

10:49.757 --> 10:51.594
She's going to nullify them all.

10:52.386 --> 10:53.890
Damn her!

10:54.349 --> 10:55.852
Retreat, Akai.

10:56.186 --> 10:59.568
If you boost the activation
of your Para-someinine any further,

10:59.568 --> 11:01.656
your body will succumb
to your fire cell output,

11:01.656 --> 11:03.576
and you'll burn to death.

11:05.454 --> 11:07.333
Your body has value.

11:07.834 --> 11:11.717
For the sake of the new world
and for your own sake, don't waste it.

11:12.134 --> 11:13.387
What do I care?

11:14.180 --> 11:16.644
For the sake of this crappy world?

11:16.644 --> 11:18.230
For my own sake?

11:18.230 --> 11:19.817
For my dead family's sake?

11:20.610 --> 11:22.865
I don't give a damn about any of that!

11:23.240 --> 11:25.954
I just want to murder
everyone that annoys me!

11:25.954 --> 11:28.333
It's not like I care who it is that dies!

11:33.678 --> 11:35.890
So what if I die myself?

11:35.890 --> 11:37.393
I could care less!

11:39.230 --> 11:41.318
She's blown past critical temperate, eh?

11:42.445 --> 11:44.407
Chacha, activate the fireproof wall.

11:44.909 --> 11:45.994
Roger that.

11:46.286 --> 11:48.833
This was a great way to kill time.

11:49.334 --> 11:50.545
So long.

12:08.539 --> 12:12.506
I don't see you as someone
I could care less about.

12:15.887 --> 12:17.724
Cascading Kumite, Easterly Wind.

12:17.724 --> 12:18.559
CASCADING KUMITE
EASTERLY WIND

12:29.998 --> 12:34.758
She even blasted away
the Hazakura sparks inside her cells

12:35.259 --> 12:38.683
and sublimated all of her malice.

12:39.727 --> 12:44.611
It's no use telling someone who's lost
everything not to give in to despair.

12:45.530 --> 12:46.364
But you know what?

12:47.283 --> 12:48.870
I happen to know a kid...

12:49.913 --> 12:51.625
who was lucky enough to overcome that.

12:52.334 --> 12:55.215
I'm sure that it was good fortune
that caused us to cross paths.

12:56.134 --> 12:57.428
So for now...

12:58.180 --> 12:59.808
just stay down for the count.

13:01.687 --> 13:03.273
You damn monster.

13:04.943 --> 13:07.949
Futaba here. I've subdued one enemy.

13:08.659 --> 13:11.832
I've also detected
a power similar to Blooming.

13:12.333 --> 13:13.711
Watch your backs.

13:17.928 --> 13:19.097
Ms. Akai.

13:19.097 --> 13:21.226
Her vital signs are intact.

13:21.226 --> 13:22.646
She's only lost consciousness.

13:23.564 --> 13:26.361
Chacha, what's the situation
inside the hideout?

13:26.654 --> 13:29.827
Odds of enemy attack, 26%.

13:30.369 --> 13:33.543
They'll run into Aonuma
within two minutes.

13:33.668 --> 13:34.503
Hmm.

13:35.045 --> 13:35.922
Oh, well.

13:35.922 --> 13:40.264
Even if this hideout is destroyed,
it won't affect the Seed-Sowing Project.

13:42.017 --> 13:45.440
The Goddess of Victory is in my hands.

13:45.440 --> 13:47.904
NAME OF TEST SUBJECT: REI YOZAKURA
DATE OF CONTAINMENT:

13:48.614 --> 13:51.871
Shion, did you glean anything
from the enemy transmissions?

13:52.121 --> 13:54.458
Yeah, aside from the transmission logs,

13:54.458 --> 13:57.131
I was able to extract
the test subject data for their research

13:57.131 --> 13:59.051
and info on the passcodes for the hideout.

13:59.511 --> 14:02.224
I'm going to incorporate all that
into the infiltration route.

14:03.101 --> 14:04.980
I've got the passcode
for the Research Wing.

14:05.397 --> 14:08.445
Nanao and Kengo,
head over to rescue the test subjects.

14:08.738 --> 14:09.615
See you!

14:14.666 --> 14:16.002
Excuse me!

14:19.635 --> 14:22.014
Tear gas sure comes in handy!

14:27.776 --> 14:30.698
Brr! Are you okay, Nanao?

14:30.698 --> 14:33.537
The gas crystallized in the cold air?

14:34.080 --> 14:36.209
Brr! So cold.

14:37.461 --> 14:40.677
Grandma was always telling me
not to let my body get too cold,

14:40.677 --> 14:43.181
so I'm going to get this over with fast.

14:45.268 --> 14:47.439
The power to adjust cold air.

14:47.941 --> 14:51.615
Hey, it must be cool for you
in the summer. Lucky you!

14:52.116 --> 14:55.080
But if you lay a finger
on my beloved kid brother...

14:56.959 --> 14:59.046
we won't let you get away with it!

14:59.463 --> 15:00.633
Ugh.

15:00.883 --> 15:03.806
Made by the PoPoPPo Toy Store,
under Mr. Kengo's supervision,

15:03.806 --> 15:05.935
the balloon puppets, Kengo-chan!

15:06.352 --> 15:08.816
Thanks to microchips
and Steel Spider control,

15:08.816 --> 15:10.485
I've been replicated to perfection!

15:11.154 --> 15:14.452
Yay! Super Kengo Festival!

15:15.078 --> 15:16.915
What a pain.

15:18.878 --> 15:19.880
Wrong one!

15:20.590 --> 15:22.092
My bad, Kawashita.

15:22.092 --> 15:24.472
There's been a surge in enemies,
and I'm short-handed.

15:28.731 --> 15:30.943
Looks like they're targeting
the Research Wing.

15:32.071 --> 15:34.701
To release the test subjects?

15:34.701 --> 15:37.916
It wouldn't do
to lose our data and samples.

15:38.291 --> 15:42.675
Hmm, so why don't we have Kurosawa
dispose of the test subjects?

15:43.009 --> 15:43.844
Huh?

15:44.261 --> 15:47.434
Aonuma, I want you
to secure the power source.

15:48.019 --> 15:50.107
Huh? What a drag.

15:52.027 --> 15:54.156
Guess I'll end this right now.

15:59.166 --> 16:00.001
Huh?

16:00.753 --> 16:02.507
We were just getting started!

16:02.507 --> 16:04.093
Where'd he go?

16:04.093 --> 16:05.470
Guess I have no choice.

16:05.721 --> 16:08.059
This is what they call
a strategic retreat.

16:08.059 --> 16:11.357
No! Some of them are my friends!

16:11.357 --> 16:13.904
Hey, I'll bring you some new ones, then.

16:13.904 --> 16:15.323
But that's not--

16:19.081 --> 16:23.298
I-I'm sorry for being unreasonable,
Mr. Mizuki.

16:26.262 --> 16:29.476
So, anyway, Kurosawa,
you can put that off 'til later.

16:29.853 --> 16:33.986
To the Research Wing on the double.
Some collateral damage should be fine.

16:50.978 --> 16:52.607
Even his own allies?

16:55.947 --> 16:57.241
That's that guy from Nijibana.

16:58.034 --> 16:59.495
Oh, crap! Don't stand in his--

17:02.000 --> 17:05.925
His greatest weapon is his lack of fear.

17:06.425 --> 17:09.348
He has no interest in his own death,
nor in other people's deaths.

17:09.849 --> 17:15.110
That's why his attacks
are as cold and indifferent as iron.

17:15.778 --> 17:17.824
It's no good! We can't escape!

17:17.824 --> 17:18.826
Damn it!

17:45.796 --> 17:49.596
An organic alloy that uses electric shocks
to the muscles to change shape...

17:49.596 --> 17:50.723
Black Shadow Stone.

17:51.642 --> 17:55.900
I'd heard that the Yozakuras
also had a similar refining technology.

17:57.110 --> 18:01.077
It's theoretically made of metal,
which makes it good for landing blows...

18:03.540 --> 18:05.878
But the cells themselves aren't ductile.

18:06.713 --> 18:10.303
With modifications,
I can crush you like I would with pliers.

18:11.765 --> 18:13.811
Weapons are for protecting people.

18:14.478 --> 18:18.361
All your weapons do is hurt others
or cause them suffering...

18:18.862 --> 18:20.323
so they don't cut it for me!

18:30.594 --> 18:31.429
What the--

18:36.147 --> 18:37.232
Shion?

18:37.650 --> 18:38.944
I separated you remotely.

18:51.051 --> 18:53.473
But he'll be coming through in 30 seconds.

18:54.183 --> 18:56.228
He's not a good match for you.

18:56.228 --> 19:00.361
I'll stop him on my end,
so you go back up Taiyo and the others.

19:05.497 --> 19:08.587
No, there's no better match than me.

19:09.923 --> 19:11.050
It's all right.

19:11.760 --> 19:14.014
If it comes to it,
I'll activate my Blooming.

19:15.475 --> 19:18.439
Don't push yourself like that!
You haven't done it in years!

19:18.774 --> 19:21.320
Big Sis said
that she'd activated hers, right?

19:21.822 --> 19:24.911
It's time for me to step up, too.

19:25.538 --> 19:27.332
I'll be the one to stop him.

19:29.546 --> 19:30.798
Would you stop with this non--

19:30.798 --> 19:33.512
MASTER SHINZO, FIGHT!!
You can do it, Master Shinzo!

19:33.971 --> 19:35.098
A-Ayaka!

19:35.098 --> 19:37.728
M-My ears! My ears!

19:38.062 --> 19:40.149
While we were preparing for this campaign,

19:40.149 --> 19:41.945
even while I was accompanying him,

19:42.237 --> 19:45.451
Master Shinzo
had already made up his mind!

19:46.538 --> 19:47.455
And...

19:49.627 --> 19:54.428
he resurrected the Yozakura refining
technology to create a formless alloy...

19:56.516 --> 20:00.481
extremely sensitive,
as well as requiring dexterous handling,

20:00.816 --> 20:04.616
while boasting the fluidity of liquid
and the hardness of steel.

20:05.325 --> 20:07.872
The new weapon, Turmeric,

20:07.872 --> 20:11.838
is the manifestation
of Master Shinzo's resolve!

20:15.638 --> 20:16.931
One Hundred Eight Bell Tolls!

20:26.618 --> 20:28.037
Celestial Serpent Slaying Sword!

20:42.817 --> 20:43.819
I'm trapped inside?

20:49.496 --> 20:50.999
Hayato Shield!

21:02.898 --> 21:04.569
Afraid of his Blooming?

21:04.569 --> 21:05.403
SHINZO, 14 YEARS OLD

21:05.403 --> 21:07.365
So he's still traumatized.

21:07.365 --> 21:09.787
Was the mission that horrific?

21:09.787 --> 21:13.252
No. Considering Shinzo's potential,
it's not an issue.

21:13.545 --> 21:16.467
It's just that he awakened his Blooming
the first time by accident.

21:17.302 --> 21:20.183
Apparently,
even his own memories of it are vague.

21:20.559 --> 21:23.732
It's a good type of Blooming,
but it seems hard to handle.

21:26.028 --> 21:30.244
Shinzo's the kind of boy who wants
to protect others with his strength,

21:30.244 --> 21:34.545
so it might be that he dislikes
his weakness in having hurt someone.

21:35.756 --> 21:37.635
It might be that it frightens him.

21:40.223 --> 21:46.820
But it's only the truly strong and kind
who can fear their own power.

21:47.738 --> 21:51.495
Your mother loves you
for being like that, Shinzo.

22:00.221 --> 22:01.933
Melting Rock Glaive!

22:07.570 --> 22:09.824
To stop you as a weapon,

22:10.324 --> 22:12.788
I'm going to awaken the weapon inside me.

22:13.205 --> 22:14.499
Please...

22:14.499 --> 22:16.504
don't end up getting killed by me.

23:50.942 --> 23:55.952
NEXT TIME SHION & KENGO
VS. CHACHA & AONUMA
